
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Verificar API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Informações do modelo
GET {{baseUrl}}/model-info

### 3. Predição válida
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Hours_Studied": 20,
  "Attendance": 85,
  "Parental_Involvement": "Medium",
  "Access_to_Resources": "High",
  "Extracurricular_Activities": "Yes",
  "Sleep_Hours": 7,
  "Previous_Scores": 75,
  "Motivation_Level": "Medium",
  "Internet_Access": "Yes",
  "Tutoring_Sessions": 2,
  "Family_Income": "Medium",
  "Teacher_Quality": "Good",
  "School_Type": "Public",
  "Peer_Influence": "Positive",
  "Physical_Activity": 3,
  "Learning_Disabilities": "No",
  "Parental_Education_Level": "College",
  "Distance_from_Home": "Near",
  "Gender": "Female"
}

### 4. Predição inválida: frequência acima de 100%
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Hours_Studied": 20,
  "Attendance": 150
}

### 5. Endpoint inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/inexistente
